; answers an unregistered extension's command, executable and icon from
; it). The layout, value types and default verb of Windows 11 25H2's
; (`reg query HKCR\Unknown /s`, measured on 26200, issue #61): every
; command REG_EXPAND_SZ with a DelegateExecute CLSID beside it, the
; default verb `openas` a REG_SZ.
